## **Step 12: User Clears the PDF**

```javascript
clearBtn.addEventListener("click", function () {
    pdfInput.value = "";
    clearViewer();
    fileInfo.textContent = "Select a PDF file from your computer.";
});

function clearViewer() {
    if (pageObserver) pageObserver.disconnect();  // Stop watching
    currentPDF = null;                            // Clear PDF object
    pdfContainer.innerHTML = "";                  // Remove all pages
    pdfInfo.classList.add("d-none");              // Hide info
    error.classList.add("d-none");                // Hide errors
}
```

